<title>LITHUANIA: HERMIS BANK SAYS ON TARGET FOR 97 FORECAST.</title>
<headline>HERMIS BANK SAYS ON TARGET FOR 97 FORECAST.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lithuania's second largest bank Hermis Bank said on Wednesday that it was on target for its forecast 40.6 million litas year profit.</p>
<p>&quot;The shareholders of the bank decided to target a 40.6 million net profit in 1997 and we are keeping pace with the plan,&quot; Hermis deputy chairman Vytautas Jurna said.</p>
<p>The bank had an audited 27.4 million litas net profit in 1996.</p>
<p>-- Andrius Vilkancas, Vilnius newsroom +370 2 223 517</p>
